Go in FastAPI folder and run this command
uvicorn ekantiks_api:app --reload

Then go to this site : http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask


Incase everything go wrong these are all the libraries to install immediately in a new env 

pip install langchain
pip install langchain-community
pip install langchain-chroma
pip install chromadb
pip install fastapi uvicorn
pip install sentence-transformers
pip install jinja2
pip install langchain_groq
pip install langdetect
pip install deep_translator
